-<section class="faqsec" data-sec="General" id="general" style="--c:#D4A856"><h2>General</h2><p class="sub">15 questions</p><details class="qa"><summary>What is SideKix?</summary><div class="body"><p>SideKix is a revolutionary entrepreneurship operating system designed to connect brilliant ideas with successful business execution. By combining artificial intelligence with human expertise, SideKix provides the tools, roadmap, and community necessary to turn raw ambition into thriving enterprises, contributing to growth and innovation.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Who is SideKix for?</summary><div class="body"><p>If you have a business idea but feel stuck due to a lack of time, money, or a professional network, or if you even need help coming up with a business idea, SideKix is for you. We support everyone from potential entrepreneurs, first-time founders to small business owners looking for a smarter, more affordable way to live and grow.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Is SideKix a consulting firm?</summary><div class="body"><p>Not exactly. While we offer expert guidance and resources, we focus on support, empowerment, learning, accessibility and actionable tactics. We aren't here to just give you a slide deck; we are here to be your "SideKix", the partner that helps you right when you need it most.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Can I use SideKix if I already have a full-time job?</summary><div class="body"><p>Yes, most of our community members are "SideKix’n” their way into entrepreneurship. Our platform is built for flexibility, allowing you to schedule sessions and access resources on a timeline that fits your current schedule.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Do I need a fully-formed business plan to join?</summary><div class="body"><p>Not at all. In fact, many of our members join when they only have a "napkin sketch" of an idea or want us to help them come up with an idea. SideKix is designed to help you build that plan from the ground up, so you don't waste time or money on the wrong steps.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What if I’m afraid to fail or don't know where to start?</summary><div class="body"><p>That’s why we exist. SideKix removes the "fear factor" by breaking down the complex world of business into manageable steps, backed by a community that has your back when things get tough.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>How do I get started?</summary><div class="body"><p>The best way to begin is by signing up for early access on our homepage. You’ll be the first to know about new resources, community events, and our official nationwide rollout.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>When will SideKix be fully available?</summary><div class="body"><p>We are currently in a high-growth phase and are gearing up for a full nationwide launch this year. Join the waitlist now to secure your spot in the first wave.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Is there a cost to join the waitlist?</summary><div class="body"><p>No. Joining the waitlist and signing up for early access costs nothing. It’s the best way to secure your spot and stay informed about our rollout.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>How much does a SideKix membership cost?</summary><div class="body"><p>We believe in removing financial barriers, not creating them. We are committed to an affordable, value-driven model. You can find our tier options and pricing on our website under members.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Is there a tier that costs nothing?</summary><div class="body"><p>We intend to offer a range of resources that are accessible to everyone in our community. Specific details on which features are included at each tier will be shared closer to our official launch date.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Are there any long-term contracts?</summary><div class="body"><p>We value flexibility. Our goal is to support your business as it grows, which means offering membership options that allow you to scale up or down based on your current needs without being locked into rigid, multi-year contracts.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What features do members get access to?</summary><div class="body"><p>Members get access to a library of "plug-and-play" resources, including budget templates, legal checklists, branding guides, and growth frameworks that are proven to work in real-world local markets.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Does SideKix help with local networking?</summary><div class="body"><p>Absolutely. We emphasize "keeping your roots." Our community hubs are designed to connect you with other entrepreneurs and resources specifically in your city or region, making local growth a priority.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>How can I stay updated?</summary><div class="body"><p>Sign up for our email list for the latest updates and news.</p></div></details></section><section class="faqsec" data-sec="Members" id="members" style="--c:#6FB0E0"><h2>Members</h2><p class="sub">21 questions</p><details class="qa"><summary>What happens after I purchase a membership?</summary><div class="body"><p>Once your purchase is complete, your membership benefits become available immediately. You can begin accessing SideKix features including AI guidance, training sessions, and any other listed or stated features of the membership tier you purchased.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Can I cancel my membership?</summary><div class="body"><p>Yes. You can cancel your membership at any time through your account settings or through the billing platform used for your purchase. Canceling stops future renewals but does not provide a refund for the current billing period. Your access continues until the end of the paid period.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Can I upgrade my membership?</summary><div class="body"><p>Yes. If you upgrade to a higher membership tier, the change takes effect immediately and you gain access to the new features right away. The billing platform may charge a prorated amount for the upgrade.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Can I downgrade my membership?</summary><div class="body"><p>Yes. If you downgrade to a lower membership tier, the change takes effect at the next billing renewal date. Your current membership benefits remain active until then.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Can I switch from monthly to yearly billing?</summary><div class="body"><p>Yes. When switching from monthly to yearly billing, the change usually takes effect immediately and the billing platform may apply a credit for unused time.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Can I switch from yearly to monthly billing?</summary><div class="body"><p>Yes. However, the change takes effect after the current yearly billing period ends.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>How do refunds work?</summary><div class="body"><p>SideKix memberships are non-refundable. If you purchased through Apple App Store or Google Play, refund requests must be submitted directly through those platforms. Approval is determined by the store’s policies.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What if my payment fails?</summary><div class="body"><p>If your payment method fails, the billing platform may retry the charge and notify you to update your payment method. If payment cannot be completed, your membership may be suspended until payment is resolved.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Do I lose access if I cancel?</summary><div class="body"><p>No. Canceling only stops future billing. You continue to have full access until the end of your current billing period.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What happens if I cancel my membership and then come back? Do you save my journey?</summary><div class="body"><p>We will archive your information and progress for up to 60 days. Inactive accounts will receive a series of reminders and notifications based on your preferences.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What are the benefits of being a "Founding Member"?</summary><div class="body"><p>Early adopters who join during our launch phase will receive exclusive perks, including locked-in introductory pricing, priority matching with top-tier Advisors, and early access to new tactical tools.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>How does SideKix help me scale my business?</summary><div class="body"><p>We provide a tactical framework to help you adapt to market changes without needing to cut your team or relocate. We focus on lean, smart growth that respects your budget and needs.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Does SideKix take equity in my company?</summary><div class="body"><p>No. Our goal is to make entrepreneurship attainable, not to take a piece of your dream. We focus on providing accessible support systems that keep you in the driver’s seat. Remember, you’re the hero - we’re your SideKix.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What happens in a typical SideKix Advisor session?</summary><div class="body"><p>Sessions are tactical and action-oriented. You’ll meet with an Advisor to tackle a specific roadblock—whether it’s refining your business model, setting up your first marketing campaign, or navigating local regulations. You’ll walk away with a clear "next step" action list.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What kind of time commitment is expected of me?</summary><div class="body"><p>As much or as little as you can give! SideKix is built for the "busy entrepreneur." Whether you have just two hours per week or two hours per day, our tactical tools are designed to give you the most impact in the shortest amount of time.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Can I access SideKix on my phone?</summary><div class="body"><p>Yes! The SideKix platform is designed to be mobile-friendly so you can chat with your community, book sessions, and review tactical guides while you’re on the go or working at your "day job."</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Will SideKix help me find funding or investors?</summary><div class="body"><p>While we aren't a venture capital firm, we provide the tactical prep needed to get a loan or "investor-ready." We can help you refine your pitch, clean up your finances and budgets, and connect you with community members and financial institutions who have successfully navigated the funding process.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>How do I choose the right Advisor for my business?</summary><div class="body"><p>Our platform uses a smart-matching system based on your industry, current challenges, and goals. You can browse Advisor profiles to see their track record, specific areas of expertise (like marketing, operations, or finance), and reviews from other SideKix members.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Can I change my Advisor if it’s not a good fit?</summary><div class="body"><p>Absolutely. We believe chemistry is key to growth. If a specific Advisor’s style doesn’t mesh with yours, you can explore other experts in our network at any time.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Is there a community forum for members?</summary><div class="body"><p>Yes! Beyond one-on-one sessions, you gain access to our complementary community hub. This is where you can connect and network with others, share "wins," and get quick feedback from peers.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>How can I contact the team directly?</summary><div class="body"><p>You can reach us through the contact form on our website for any additional inquiries.</p></div></details></section><section class="faqsec" data-sec="Advisors" id="advisors" style="--c:#A6E0B4"><h2>Advisors</h2><p class="sub">14 questions</p><details class="qa"><summary>What is a SideKix Advisor?</summary><div class="body"><p>A SideKix Advisor is a vetted entrepreneur, operator, and/or leader who provides experience-based guidance to entrepreneurs and small business owners. Advisors bring clarity, strategy, and perspective.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Who can apply to be an Advisor?</summary><div class="body"><p>We welcome applications from:</p><ul><li>Experienced founders</li><li>Small business owners</li><li>Experienced Corporate leaders (Director/VP or higher)</li><li>Fractional executives</li><li>University mentors or ecosystem builders</li></ul><p>If you have real-world experience worth sharing, you may be a great fit.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Is this a paid role?</summary><div class="body"><p>Yes. It depends on the format. For Sessions you choose whether to charge at all, and if you do, the price is fixed by SideKix so support stays within reach of the people who need it. Open office hours at no charge work the same way. Live Events and Expert Content are yours to shape: you determine what you offer and what it costs, including offering it at no charge if you want to give back to the community. SideKix is here with assistance or suggestions if you want them.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>How much can I earn as an Advisor?</summary><div class="body"><p>Paid sessions are a fixed rate of $70 per hour, set by SideKix so the price stays the same for every member, and you can also run sessions at no charge if you want to. On top of that you can offer Expert Content and host Live Events, where you determine what you charge, including nothing at all. The system is set up for you to build credibility and increase your influence to earn more over time.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What is the time commitment?</summary><div class="body"><p>Completely flexible. You choose:</p><p>Note: Most Advisors start with 1–3 sessions per month and scale from there.</p><ul><li>how many sessions you want</li><li>your availability</li><li>your session duration and frequency</li></ul></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Do I need previous coaching or mentoring experience?</summary><div class="body"><p>Not required, but it helps. We look for clear communication, empathy, and a desire to help others.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What happens after I apply?</summary><div class="body"><p>Our team reviews your experience and alignment with our Advisor standards:</p><p>Next Steps: If approved, you’ll receive onboarding instructions to build your Advisor profile.</p><ul><li>Integrity</li><li>Real-world experience</li><li>Strong communication</li><li>Values alignment</li></ul></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What does onboarding include?</summary><div class="body"><p>You’ll complete:</p><ul><li>A brief orientation</li><li>Your Advisor public profile</li><li>A simple rate setup</li><li>A headshot + short bio</li><li>Availability preferences</li></ul></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>How do members select Advisors?</summary><div class="body"><p>Members browse Advisor profiles based on their needs and/or challenges (marketing, strategy, leadership, operations, mindset, etc.) and book directly through the platform.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Where do sessions take place?</summary><div class="body"><p>All sessions start through SideKix direct messaging. Advisors will have the option to turn sessions into a video call. You will use the SideKix web portal for scheduling availability and facilitating sessions.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Do Advisors need to prepare for sessions?</summary><div class="body"><p>We suggest reviewing the member’s intake form before each session. This ensures a highly personalized, high-value experience. Prior to each session, the user has an option to send you information and documents. You do not have to work alone. You can work with the SideKix team to help you prepare and create an amazing User or Member experience.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Is there a contract?</summary><div class="body"><p>You agree to the SideKix Advisor Code of Excellence and standard platform terms. There is no long-term commitment. You may pause or cancel any time.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Can Advisors get featured or highlighted?</summary><div class="body"><p>Yes. We regularly spotlight Advisors through:</p><ul><li>Social media</li><li>Newsletters</li><li>Founder suggestions</li><li>Events and workshops</li><li>Publicity/earned media opportunities</li></ul></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What makes a great Advisor?</summary><div class="body"><p>Great Advisors are:</p><ul><li>Experienced</li><li>Empathetic</li><li>Clear, curious, communicators</li><li>Encouraging but honest</li><li>Good listeners</li><li>Solutions-oriented</li><li>Respectful of all experience levels</li></ul></div></details></section><section class="faqsec" data-sec="Kix Credits" id="kix-credits" style="--c:#CEA7DB"><h2>Kix Credits</h2><p class="sub">9 questions</p><details class="qa"><summary>What are Kix Credits?</summary><div class="body"><p>Kix Credits are how conversation with Kix is measured. Every time you talk something through, a small amount of your balance is used. Think of credits as your conversation fuel.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What does a pack of Kix Credits cost?</summary><div class="body"><p>350 Kix Credits is $19, which covers up to 90 minutes of conversation with Kix. When your balance runs out, you can pick up another 350 credits for $19 whenever you’re ready to keep going. There is no membership and no recurring charge, you buy conversation when you want it.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What uses my credits?</summary><div class="body"><p>Only live conversation with Kix draws down your balance. Your Milestones and Step work are unmetered, so you can build, revise, and work through your roadmap as much as you want without spending a single credit. Credits are for talking it out; the work itself is always open to you.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>How do I know how many credits I have left?</summary><div class="body"><p>Your balance is always visible in the app, shown in credits. You’ll know exactly where you stand before you start a conversation.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Will I get a warning before I run out?</summary><div class="body"><p>Yes. When you’re down to 20% of your balance, we’ll let you know between conversations, never in the middle of one. We won’t interrupt you mid-thought to talk about billing.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Do Kix Credits expire?</summary><div class="body"><p>No. Credits you’ve purchased are yours to keep. There is no monthly reset, no use it or lose it, and no expiration date.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Is there a limit on how much I can use in a day?</summary><div class="body"><p>There is a daily cap of up to 90 minutes of conversation with Kix. It keeps the platform fair and running well for everyone, and for nearly every member it is a ceiling you will never reach. Your Milestones and Step work stay open all day regardless.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>How do I pay?</summary><div class="body"><p>Kix Credits are purchased through the App Store using your Apple Account.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Is SideKix available on Android or the web?</summary><div class="body"><p>Not yet. We are launching on iOS first so we can get the core experience right, then rolling out in phases from there. Join the waitlist and you will be the first to know when your platform is live.</p></div></details></section>
