chive your information and progress for up to 60 days. Inactive accounts will receive a series of reminders and notifications based on your preferences.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What are the benefits of being a "Founding Member"?</summary><div class="body"><p>Early adopters who join during our launch phase will receive exclusive perks, including locked-in introductory pricing, priority matching with top-tier Advisors, and early access to new tactical tools.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>How does SideKix help me scale my business?</summary><div class="body"><p>We provide a tactical framework to help you adapt to market changes without needing to cut your team or relocate. We focus on lean, smart growth that respects your budget and needs.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Does SideKix take equity in my company?</summary><div class="body"><p>No. Our goal is to make entrepreneurship attainable, not to take a piece of your dream. We focus on providing accessible support systems that keep you in the driver’s seat. Remember, you’re the hero - we’re your SideKix.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What happens in a typical SideKix Advisor session?</summary><div class="body"><p>Sessions are tactical and action-oriented. You’ll meet with an Advisor to tackle a specific roadblock—whether it’s refining your business model, setting up your first marketing campaign, or navigating local regulations. You’ll walk away with a clear "next step" action list.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What kind of time commitment is expected of me?</summary><div class="body"><p>As much or as little as you can give! SideKix is built for the "busy entrepreneur." Whether you have just two hours per week or two hours per day, our tactical tools are designed to give you the most impact in the shortest amount of time.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Can I access SideKix on my phone?</summary><div class="body"><p>Yes! The SideKix platform is designed to be mobile-friendly so you can chat with your community, book sessions, and review tactical guides while you’re on the go or working at your "day job."</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Will SideKix help me find funding or investors?</summary><div class="body"><p>While we aren't a venture capital firm, we provide the tactical prep needed to get a loan or "investor-ready." We can help you refine your pitch, clean up your finances and budgets, and connect you with community members and financial institutions who have successfully navigated the funding process.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>How do I choose the right Advisor for my business?</summary><div class="body"><p>Our platform uses a smart-matching system based on your industry, current challenges, and goals. You can browse Advisor profiles to see their track record, specific areas of expertise (like marketing, operations, or finance), and reviews from other SideKix members.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Can I change my Advisor if it’s not a good fit?</summary><div class="body"><p>Absolutely. We believe chemistry is key to growth. If a specific Advisor’s style doesn’t mesh with yours, you can explore other experts in our network at any time.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Is there a community forum for members?</summary><div class="body"><p>Yes! Beyond one-on-one sessions, you gain access to our complementary community hub. This is where you can connect and network with others, share "wins," and get quick feedback from peers.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>How can I contact the team directly?</summary><div class="body"><p>You can reach us through the contact form on our website for any additional inquiries.</p></div></details></section><section class="faqsec" data-sec="Advisors" id="advisors" style="--c:#A6E0B4"><h2>Advisors</h2><p class="sub">14 questions</p><details class="qa"><summary>What is a SideKix Advisor?</summary><div class="body"><p>A SideKix Advisor is a vetted entrepreneur, operator, and/or leader who provides experience-based guidance to entrepreneurs and small business owners. Advisors bring clarity, strategy, and perspective.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Who can apply to be an Advisor?</summary><div class="body"><p>We welcome applications from:</p><ul><li>Experienced founders</li><li>Small business owners</li><li>Experienced Corporate leaders (Director/VP or higher)</li><li>Fractional executives</li><li>University mentors or ecosystem builders</li></ul><p>If you have real-world experience worth sharing, you may be a great fit.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Is this a paid role?</summary><div class="body"><p>Yes. It depends on the format. For Sessions you choose whether to charge at all, and if you do, the price is fixed by SideKix so support stays within reach of the people who need it. Open office hours at no charge work the same way. Live Events and Expert Content are yours to shape: you determine what you offer and what it costs, including offering it at no charge if you want to give back to the community. SideKix is here with assistance or suggestions if you want them.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>How much can I earn as an Advisor?</summary><div class="body"><p>Paid sessions are a fixed rate of $70 per hour, set by SideKix so the price stays the same for every member, and you can also run sessions at no charge if you want to. On top of that you can offer Expert Content and host Live Events, where you determine what you charge, including nothing at all. The system is set up for you to build credibility and increase your influence to earn more over time.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What is the time commitment?</summary><div class="body"><p>Completely flexible. You choose:</p><p>Note: Most Advisors start with 1–3 sessions per month and scale from there.</p><ul><li>how many sessions you want</li><li>your availability</li><li>your session duration and frequency</li></ul></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Do I need previous coaching or mentoring experience?</summary><div class="body"><p>Not required, but it helps. We look for clear communication, empathy, and a desire to help others.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What happens after I apply?</summary><div class="body"><p>Our team reviews your experience and alignment with our Advisor standards:</p><p>Next Steps: If approved, you’ll receive onboarding instructions to build your Advisor profile.</p><ul><li>Integrity</li><li>Real-world experience</li><li>Strong communication</li><li>Values alignment</li></ul></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What does onboarding include?</summary><div class="body"><p>You’ll complete:</p><ul><li>A brief orientation</li><li>Your Advisor public profile</li><li>A simple rate setup</li><li>A headshot + short bio</li><li>Availability preferences</li></ul></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>How do members select Advisors?</summary><div class="body"><p>Members browse Advisor profiles based on their needs and/or challenges (marketing, strategy, leadership, operations, mindset, etc.) and book directly through the platform.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Where do sessions take place?</summary><div class="body"><p>All sessions start through SideKix direct messaging. Advisors will have the option to turn sessions into a video call. You will use the SideKix web portal for scheduling availability and facilitating sessions.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Do Advisors need to prepare for sessions?</summary><div class="body"><p>We suggest reviewing the member’s intake form before each session. This ensures a highly personalized, high-value experience. Prior to each session, the user has an option to send you information and documents. You do not have to work alone. You can work with the SideKix team to help you prepare and create an amazing User or Member experience.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Is there a contract?</summary><div class="body"><p>You agree to the SideKix Advisor Code of Excellence and standard platform terms. There is no long-term commitment. You may pause or cancel any time.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Can Advisors get featured or highlighted?</summary><div class="body"><p>Yes. We regularly spotlight Advisors through:</p><ul><li>Social media</li><li>Newsletters</li><li>Founder suggestions</li><li>Events and workshops</li><li>Publicity/earned media opportunities</li></ul></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What makes a great Advisor?</summary><div class="body"><p>Great Advisors are:</p><ul><li>Experienced</li><li>Empathetic</li><li>Clear, curious, communicators</li><li>Encouraging but honest</li><li>Good listeners</li><li>Solutions-oriented</li><li>Respectful of all experience levels</li></ul></div></details></section><section class="faqsec" data-sec="Kix Credits" id="kix-credits" style="--c:#CEA7DB"><h2>Kix Credits</h2><p class="sub">9 questions</p><details class="qa"><summary>What are Kix Credits?</summary><div class="body"><p>Kix Credits are how conversation with Kix is measured, whether you speak or type. Every time you work something through with Kix, a small amount of your balance is used. Think of credits as your conversation fuel.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What does a pack of Kix Credits cost?</summary><div class="body"><p>350 Kix Credits is $19, which covers up to 90 minutes of conversation with Kix. When your balance runs out, you can pick up another 350 credits for $19 whenever you’re ready to keep going. There is no membership and no recurring charge, you buy conversation when you want it.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>What uses my credits?</summary><div class="body"><p>Conversation with Kix draws down your balance, both voice and messaging. Your Milestones and Step work are unmetered, so you can build, revise, and work through your roadmap as much as you want without spending a single credit. Credits are for working things through with Kix; the work itself is always open to you.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>How do I know how many credits I have left?</summary><div class="body"><p>Your balance is always visible in the app, shown in credits. You’ll know exactly where you stand before you start a conversation.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Will I get a warning before I run out?</summary><div class="body"><p>Yes. When you’re down to 20% of your balance, we’ll let you know between conversations, never in the middle of one. We won’t interrupt you mid-thought to talk about billing.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Do Kix Credits expire?</summary><div class="body"><p>No. Credits you’ve purchased are yours to keep. There is no monthly reset, no use it or lose it, and no expiration date.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Is there a limit on how much I can use in a day?</summary><div class="body"><p>There is a daily cap of up to 90 minutes of conversation with Kix. It keeps the platform fair and running well for everyone, and for nearly every member it is a ceiling you will never reach. Your Milestones and Step work stay open all day regardless.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>How do I pay?</summary><div class="body"><p>Kix Credits are purchased through the App Store using your Apple Account.</p></div></details><details class="qa"><summary>Is SideKix available on Android or the web?</summary><div class="body"><p>Not yet. We are launching on iOS first so we can get the core experience right, then rolling out in phases from there. Join the waitlist and you will be the first to know when your platform is live.</p></div></details></section>
