-<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "What is SideKix?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "SideKix is a revolutionary entrepreneurship operating system designed to connect brilliant ideas with successful business execution. By combining artificial intelligence with human expertise, SideKix provides the tools, roadmap, and community necessary to turn raw ambition into thriving enterprises, contributing to growth and innovation."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Who is SideKix for?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "If you have a business idea but feel stuck due to a lack of time, money, or a professional network, or if you even need help coming up with a business idea, SideKix is for you. We support everyone from potential entrepreneurs, first-time founders to small business owners looking for a smarter, more affordable way to live and grow."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Is SideKix a consulting firm?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Not exactly. While we offer expert guidance and resources, we focus on support, empowerment, learning, accessibility and actionable tactics. We aren't here to just give you a slide deck; we are here to be your \"SideKix\", the partner that helps you right when you need it most."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can I use SideKix if I already have a full-time job?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, most of our community members are \"SideKix’n” their way into entrepreneurship. Our platform is built for flexibility, allowing you to schedule sessions and access resources on a timeline that fits your current schedule."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do I need a fully-formed business plan to join?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Not at all. In fact, many of our members join when they only have a \"napkin sketch\" of an idea or want us to help them come up with an idea. SideKix is designed to help you build that plan from the ground up, so you don't waste time or money on the wrong steps."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What if I’m afraid to fail or don't know where to start?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "That’s why we exist. SideKix removes the \"fear factor\" by breaking down the complex world of business into manageable steps, backed by a community that has your back when things get tough."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do I get started?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "The best way to begin is by signing up for early access on our homepage. You’ll be the first to know about new resources, community events, and our official nationwide rollout."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "When will SideKix be fully available?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "We are currently in a high-growth phase and are gearing up for a full nationwide launch this year. Join the waitlist now to secure your spot in the first wave."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Is there a cost to join the waitlist?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "No. Joining the waitlist and signing up for early access costs nothing. It’s the best way to secure your spot and stay informed about our rollout."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How much does a SideKix membership cost?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "We believe in removing financial barriers, not creating them. We are committed to an affordable, value-driven model. You can find our tier options and pricing on our website under members."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Is there a tier that costs nothing?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "We intend to offer a range of resources that are accessible to everyone in our community. Specific details on which features are included at each tier will be shared closer to our official launch date."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Are there any long-term contracts?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "We value flexibility. Our goal is to support your business as it grows, which means offering membership options that allow you to scale up or down based on your current needs without being locked into rigid, multi-year contracts."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What features do members get access to?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Members get access to a library of \"plug-and-play\" resources, including budget templates, legal checklists, branding guides, and growth frameworks that are proven to work in real-world local markets."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Does SideKix help with local networking?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Absolutely. We emphasize \"keeping your roots.\" Our community hubs are designed to connect you with other entrepreneurs and resources specifically in your city or region, making local growth a priority."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How can I stay updated?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Sign up for our email list for the latest updates and news."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What happens after I purchase a membership?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Once your purchase is complete, your membership benefits become available immediately. You can begin accessing SideKix features including AI guidance, training sessions, and any other listed or stated features of the membership tier you purchased."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can I cancel my membership?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. You can cancel your membership at any time through your account settings or through the billing platform used for your purchase. Canceling stops future renewals but does not provide a refund for the current billing period. Your access continues until the end of the paid period."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can I upgrade my membership?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. If you upgrade to a higher membership tier, the change takes effect immediately and you gain access to the new features right away. The billing platform may charge a prorated amount for the upgrade."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can I downgrade my membership?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. If you downgrade to a lower membership tier, the change takes effect at the next billing renewal date. Your current membership benefits remain active until then."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can I switch from monthly to yearly billing?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. When switching from monthly to yearly billing, the change usually takes effect immediately and the billing platform may apply a credit for unused time."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can I switch from yearly to monthly billing?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. However, the change takes effect after the current yearly billing period ends."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do refunds work?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "SideKix memberships are non-refundable. If you purchased through Apple App Store or Google Play, refund requests must be submitted directly through those platforms. Approval is determined by the store’s policies."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What if my payment fails?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "If your payment method fails, the billing platform may retry the charge and notify you to update your payment method. If payment cannot be completed, your membership may be suspended until payment is resolved."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do I lose access if I cancel?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "No. Canceling only stops future billing. You continue to have full access until the end of your current billing period."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What happens if I cancel my membership and then come back? Do you save my journey?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Ans