From d34f8690c40ade1f17bb1c18a990f7e37cb66044 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 17:39:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] Press page: make the intro measure read as intentional

The 66ch cap on .pr-b landed within a pixel of the card grid's
two-column edge, so the alignment was real but never legible.

- Measure is now derived from the grid, calc((100% - 28px)/3*2 + 14px),
  so every intro paragraph ends exactly on the second card's right edge
- text-wrap:pretty evens the rag and removes orphans
- .pr-now bottom margin 54px to 52px, matching every other section
- Intro paragraphs go full width under 820px, where the grid is one column

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ShtmPEYjT4dDyTJLsYUeZN
---
 press.html | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/press.html b/press.html
index 441d33b..9be9ff4 100644
--- a/press.html
+++ b/press.html
@@ -2168,7 +2168,7 @@ html.kx-idle *::after{
    A writer on deadline wants three things in the first screen: something to
    paste, something to check, and someone to ask. That is the order. */
 .pr{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto}
-.pr-now{display:grid;gap:14px;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));margin:0 0 54px}
+.pr-now{display:grid;gap:14px;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));margin:0 0 52px}
 .pr-card{display:block;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid rgba(212,168,86,.24);
   border-radius:16px;padding:22px 20px;
   background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(20,18,13,.9),rgba(11,10,7,.92));
@@ -2179,7 +2179,8 @@ html.kx-idle *::after{
 .pr-s{margin:0 0 52px}
 .pr-s > h2{font-family:var(--util);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;
   color:var(--gold);margin:0 0 14px;font-weight:400}
-.pr-b{color:#A7A196;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 18px;max-width:66ch}
+.pr-b{color:#A7A196;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 18px;
+  max-width:calc((100% - 28px)/3*2 + 14px);text-wrap:pretty}
 .pr-quote{margin:0 0 18px;padding:22px 24px;border-left:2px solid rgba(212,168,86,.5);
   background:rgba(212,168,86,.05);color:#D8D2C4;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8}
 .pr-dl{margin:0;display:grid;gap:0}
@@ -2213,6 +2214,7 @@ html.kx-idle *::after{
 .pr-copied{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:#948D81}
 @media(max-width:820px){
   .pr-now,.pr-figs-g{grid-template-columns:1fr}
+  .pr-b{max-width:none}
   .pr-dl > div{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:5px}
   .pr-acts .kxcta{flex:1 1 100%}
 }
-- 
